{"ts": 0.065141, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[90m─\u001b[0m \u001b[93mshelltutor\u001b[0m \u001b[90m─\u001b[0m \u001b[90mStage 2 · Paths and the filesystem\u001b[0m \u001b[90m─────────────────\u001b[0m \u001b[90m○\u001b[0m\u001b[93m◉\u001b[0m\u001b[90m○\u001b[0m\u001b[90m○\u001b[0m\u001b[90m○\u001b[0m  \u001b[93m2.1\u001b[0m \u001b[90m─\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n", "len": 243}
{"ts": 0.067093, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[1;97m2.1 — where you are\u001b[0m\r\n\r\nA folder can hold files and other folders. You are always standing\r\nin one folder; the shell calls it the \u001b[36mcurrent directory\u001b[0m.\r\nYour practice folder looks like this:\r\n\r\n  \u001b[94m/var/folders/jx/f_4n055973x5cwnyh_mhlw9h0000gn/T/shelltutor-sim-home-611mh33a\u001b[0m  \u001b[93m◀ you are here\u001b[0m\r\n  ├── poem.txt\r\n  ├── numbers.txt\r\n  ├── stage1/\r\n  └── stage2/\r\n\r\n\u001b[92mpwd\u001b[0m prints the name of the current directory.\r\nPredict what it will print, then run it.\r\n\r\n\u001b[93m▶ Run \u001b[92mpwd\u001b[93m, then type \u001b[92mnext\u001b[93m.\u001b[0m\r\n", "len": 579}
{"ts": 0.067525, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[90m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[0m\r\n", "len": 251}
