{"ts": 0.089734, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[90m─\u001b[0m \u001b[93mshelltutor\u001b[0m \u001b[90m─\u001b[0m \u001b[90mStage 2 · Paths and the filesystem\u001b[0m \u001b[90m─────────────────\u001b[0m \u001b[90m○\u001b[0m\u001b[93m◉\u001b[0m\u001b[90m○\u001b[0m\u001b[90m○\u001b[0m\u001b[90m○\u001b[0m  \u001b[93m2.2\u001b[0m \u001b[90m─\u001b[0m\r\n", "len": 241}
{"ts": 0.089769, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\r\n", "len": 2}
{"ts": 0.091481, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[1;97m2.2 — ls: what is here\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n\u001b[92mls\u001b[0m lists the names in the current directory.\r\n\r\n  \u001b[92mls\u001b[0m            \u001b[90m# names only\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[92mls -p\u001b[0m         \u001b[90m# folders end in /\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[92mls -a\u001b[0m         \u001b[90m# also hidden names: those starting with .\u001b[0m\r\n\r\nPredict which names will end in \u001b[92m/\u001b[0m, then run \u001b[92mls -p\u001b[0m. The\r\ntutor keeps its own hidden files here; \u001b[92mls -a\u001b[0m shows them.\r\n\r\nThen \u001b[92mls\u001b[0m a folder you are not in:\r\n  \u001b[92mls /\u001b[0m          \u001b[90m# the top of everything\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[92mls /usr/bin\u001b[0m   \u001b[90m# long: many commands live here\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n\u001b[93m▶ Try a few, then \u001b[92mnext\u001b[93m.\u001b[0m\r\n", "len": 638}
{"ts": 0.091892, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[90m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[0m\r\n", "len": 251}
