{"ts": 0.253719, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[1;97mSTAGE 2 — GATE TASK\u001b[0m\r\n\r\nInside the practice prompt, do these (in any order):\r\n\r\n  1. make a folder called \u001b[94mpractice\u001b[0m (inside this stage's folder)\r\n  2. cd into it\r\n  3. confirm you're inside it with \u001b[92mpwd\u001b[0m\r\n\r\nThen type \u001b[92mcheck\u001b[0m.\r\n\r\n\u001b[90mI will check that the folder exists, and how you got there.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[90mThe task runs in this stage's own folder; \u001b[92mpwd\u001b[90m shows it.\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n\u001b[93m▶ Type \u001b[92mcheck\u001b[93m when done.\u001b[0m\r\n", "len": 457}
